      "cooked": "<p>I thought it would be fun and/or useful to talk about what questions we've submitted. Then we can be inspired by other questions to ask questions of our own, and cut down on duplicates. Just to be 100% sure the questions get asked, though,&nbsp;<strong>don't say what you plan to ask them until after you have already submitted it.</strong>&nbsp;Then we guarantee it gets sent and don't have a situation where the original person forgets to ask their question and the others who planned to do it too see it's already been brought up and don't do it either.</p><p>Next week is gonna be about KISMET! What questions do you have?</p><p>(I'm a little curious about this one in particular, for obvious reasons)</p>",
