      "created_at": "2017-02-22T06:28:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My just submitted question set:</p><p><span>Which other villains has Kismet interacted with the most? &nbsp;Has Dawn tried to recruit her?</span></p><p><span>Has Kismet tried dating anyone since she and Setback split up?</span></p><p><span>Kismet's curse on Setback seems really powerful. &nbsp;Can she do that sort of thing on a regular basis, or were there special circumstances?</span></p><p><span>Did Kismet do anything interesting during OblivAeon? &nbsp;If so, what?</span></p><p><span>What made Kismet unstable? &nbsp;Does 'unstable' refer to her powers or her personality?</span></p>",
