      "created_at": "2017-02-22T14:24:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I want to know how the in-game mechanic of her talisman switching from villain to player control actually plays out in the comics.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've really enjoyed the Letters Page so far. But I really would like to see more discussion of things that tie the lore and game experience together. Things like explainations of some key art peices in hero/villain decks, explainations on all incap arts, mechanics that were inspired by comic stories, that sort of thing.</p>",
