      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>UXM266 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; I asked if Setback and Guise had any wacky shenanigans together, and what are they?&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI also asked this question, or something similar! :D\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm guessing that this one was tabled for the Guise episode. &nbsp;They did state that Setback isn't meant to be a wacky character the same way Guise is, so it makes sense to me that any wacky schenanigans they do together to be filed under Guise, rather than Setback.</p>",
